# Copy to .env. Everything the app reads lives here -- there is no settings
# UI for credentials, and none of these are ever sent anywhere but to the
# provider you configure.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- provider
#
# There is nothing to choose here: whichever keys you fill in decides. Fill
# in both sets and each model says which one it wants (see POS_MODELS).

# --- Azure OpenAI ---
AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT=https://your-resource.openai.azure.com
AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY=your-key
OPENAI_API_VERSION=2025-04-01-preview

# --- OpenAI ---
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# --- LM Studio (or any OpenAI-compatible local server) ---
# No key needed. Used only if neither set above is; used as a picker entry
# (see POS_MODELS) if one is.
# LMSTUDIO_BASE_URL=http://localhost:1234/v1

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- model

# The model to use. On Azure this is a *deployment* name, chosen by whoever
# created it. Prices and the context window are looked up automatically, but
# only if that name matches the model's real name -- so name deployments
# after their model where you can.
POS_MODEL=gpt-5.6-luna

# Models the picker offers.
#
# OpenAI and LM Studio need nothing here: with OPENAI_API_KEY set, every
# chat model the key can reach is listed automatically; with
# LMSTUDIO_BASE_URL set, whatever the server currently has loaded is.
#
# Azure does, because a deployment's name is chosen when it is created and
# cannot be discovered from an API key. Name each one you want:
#
#   POS_MODELS=gpt-5.6-luna,gpt-4.1-mini
#
# Prefix with a provider to be explicit, which is what you need if more
# than one set above is present and you want a specific one:
#
#   POS_MODELS=azure_openai:gpt-5.6-luna,openai:ft:gpt-4.1:acme::abc123

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- tools

# Web search. Leave unset and the agent simply has no search tool.
# TAVILY_API_KEY=tvly-...

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- paths

# The folder the agent works in when none has been picked. Defaults to your
# home directory. The container image sets this to /workspace.
# POS_ROOT_DIR=C:/Users/you/projects

# Where chats are stored. Defaults to ./data in a checkout, or your OS
# user-data folder when installed.
# POS_DATA_DIR=

# --------------------------------------------------------------- overrides

# Only needed for a model the catalogue has never heard of, or a rate that
# changed before it caught up. Anything set here wins; anything left unset
# is looked up. Prices are USD per 1M tokens.
#
# AZURE_OPENAI_CONTEXT_WINDOW=1050000
# AZURE_OPENAI_LONG_CONTEXT_THRESHOLD=272000
# AZURE_OPENAI_PRICE_INPUT_SHORT=0.20
# AZURE_OPENAI_PRICE_CACHED_SHORT=0.02
# AZURE_OPENAI_PRICE_CACHE_WRITE_SHORT=0.25
# AZURE_OPENAI_PRICE_OUTPUT_SHORT=1.20
# AZURE_OPENAI_PRICE_INPUT_LONG=0.40
# AZURE_OPENAI_PRICE_CACHED_LONG=0.04
# AZURE_OPENAI_PRICE_CACHE_WRITE_LONG=0.50
# AZURE_OPENAI_PRICE_OUTPUT_LONG=1.80
